# The packaged app is published FLAT into this folder by `npm run dist`
# (tools/publish-flat.js), so the entry point is desktop-subtitle\早耳字幕.exe
# instead of dist\win-unpacked\早耳字幕.exe. Ignore its artifacts so ~300 MB
# never enters git. Only the source files stay tracked here: main.js,
# preload.js, package.json, package-lock.json, .gitignore, tools/ and the
# launcher scripts (启动早耳.bat / 停止早耳.bat / start_desktop_subtitle.ps1).
